WP07 Rust protocol and adapter proof

Passed:
- cargo test -p ocentra-parent-agent-protocol app_game
  Result: 5 tests passed.
- cargo test -p ocentra-parent-agent-core app_game_windows_store_inventory
  Result: 5 tests passed.

Protocol coverage:
- storePackage inventory rows serialize with packageId, bundleId,
  appUserModelId, storeId, runtimeState, and foregroundState in camelCase.
- Store/UWP fixture identities are protocol constants consumed by core tests,
  keeping Rust core source free of inline runtime strings.

Adapter/parser coverage:
- Store app row decodes as nativeApp package inventory;
- Store game row decodes as nativeGame inventory with a game category candidate;
- package and runtime process merge only through packageId or AppUserModelId;
- display label and executable path refs alone do not merge Store package rows;
- AppUserModelId can be extracted as a later policy-target handoff;
- Store package inventory rows never become runtime or foreground use rows.
